1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,700
Wrap and Bowl Kuch connects preorders, stock records, and kitchen reporting.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:11,043
Customers browse the kitchen's menu, inspect prices and portions, and add food

3
00:00:11,068 --> 00:00:12,260
before signing in.

4
00:00:12,285 --> 00:00:15,099
Their basket remains visible while they decide.

5
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,819
Checkout opens account access.

6
00:00:19,844 --> 00:00:23,928
A name, phone number and passkey create the customer account.

7
00:00:23,953 --> 00:00:27,627
No separate website password or email address is needed.

8
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:34,427
For ideas, customers choose a date, quantity and whole order budget.

9
00:00:34,452 --> 00:00:37,520
Suggestions can mix menus or repeat one menu.

10
00:00:37,545 --> 00:00:40,225
A suggestion still needs an availability check.

11
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:48,051
The customer chooses the delivery area and a permitted morning time.

12
00:00:48,076 --> 00:00:52,279
Changing the area keeps the time and rechecks the fee and stock.

13
00:00:52,304 --> 00:00:56,154
The kitchen's receiving QR is shown after the total is confirmed.

14
00:00:56,179 --> 00:00:58,268
A sample receipt is uploaded here.

15
00:00:58,293 --> 00:01:00,382
The owner must still verify payment.

16
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:10,902
The order appears in the kitchen's queue.

17
00:01:10,927 --> 00:01:15,187
Payment review and confirmation that food was received remain separate records.

18
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:20,909
Order placement deducts ingredients and packaging together.

19
00:01:20,934 --> 00:01:25,595
This example uses one hundred and thirty grams of chicken and one

20
00:01:25,620 --> 00:01:26,377
salad bowl.

21
00:01:26,402 --> 00:01:28,720
Batches must cover the delivery date.

22
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:35,982
The owner records printed dates or documented shelf life.

23
00:01:36,007 --> 00:01:39,365
Held batches and earlier limits affect usable stock.

24
00:01:39,390 --> 00:01:43,172
These records support planning, rather than guaranteeing food safety.

25
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:49,289
Daily summaries and Print all help the kitchen prepare several orders together.

26
00:01:49,314 --> 00:01:52,699
Sales and costs use their stated inclusion rules.

27
00:01:52,724 --> 00:01:55,256
Automated checks support the tested functions.

28
00:01:55,281 --> 00:01:58,665
Client and participant evaluation results are still pending.
